{\an8}<i>Ikaw ba</i>

1737
01:15:52.965 --> 01:15:55.634
{\an8}<i>Ang pumatay kay Lee Gun-jun?</i>

1738
01:16:04.309 --> 01:16:05.561
{\an8}<i>Oo, siya nga!</i>

1739
01:16:07.145 --> 01:16:08.438
{\an8}<i>Oo, siya nga!</i>

1740
01:16:08.522 --> 01:16:11.608
{\an8}MATAGUMPAY NA NAHULI ANG KULPRIT

