<i>Noon lang, bumalik si Lee Gun-mi,</i>

1866
01:22:04.169 --> 01:22:07.547
<i>Inagaw ang flash drive mula sa An Dancer,</i>

1867
01:22:07.631 --> 01:22:09.591
<i>at kumaripas ng takbo.</i>

1868
01:22:09.674 --> 01:22:11.509
<i>Hinabol niya si Lee Gun-mi</i>

1869
01:22:11.593 --> 01:22:15.764
<i>sa dead-end na eskinita sa pagitan ng Club Slam
