1870
01:22:15.847 --> 01:22:17.182
<i>Ang galit na galit na Isang Dancer</i>

1871
01:22:17.265 --> 01:22:19.976
<i>Ibinagsak si Lee Gun-mi sa pader</i>

1872
01:22:20.060 --> 01:22:21.937
<i>at kinuha ang flash drive.</i>

1873
01:22:22.020 --> 01:22:23.980
<i>Nang suntukin siya ni Lee Gun-mi,</i>

1874
01:22:24.064 --> 01:22:26.316
<i> tinulak niya siya palayo,
